Z||000008||Cameron||04-16-2001||05:29 PM||||I agree there aren't enough F1 and CART races on tv any more.  I find my self watching nascar just to see a race, but I don't like it by any means.  I love CART and F1 much better.  It's kinda annoying.<P>And on the movie "Driven" it is already better then "Days of Thunder" just because "Days of Thunder" was about Stock Cars.  I agree that it better be good.  I'm going to have to go see it in the theater when it comes out.<P><BR>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> <P>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-16-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-16-2001).]||||reg||1
